  "emphasis": {
    "primary": "Area burst (Damage on the three Ice circle strikes: Nine Hell's Spear 45, Glacial Shatter: Purgatory 45, Cerulean Storm: Avalanche 40)",
    "secondary": "Ground control (Increase Damage Taken 35% on Glacial Descent: Cocytus and Nine Hell's Spear's circle; Decrease Damage Taken 35% on Cocytus and 30% on Glacier's Will's tiles)",
    "tertiary": "Self amplification (Increase Damage Given 35% on Cerulean Storm: Avalanche and Glacier's Will over the 25% + 0.15/level bloodline passive)",
    "rationale": "Damage is the broadest tag: three Ice rows at 40/45 power on radius-1 circle strikes (Nine Hell's Spear, Glacial Shatter: Purgatory, Cerulean Storm: Avalanche), all ENEMIES-only, so burst is the primary and the AOE trait's home. The Ground Control trait lives in Glacial Descent: Cocytus (35% exposure and 35% guard on one 40 AP cast), Nine Hell's Spear's 35% circle exposure and Glacier's Will's 30% ground guard, so Increase Damage Taken and Decrease Damage Taken form the secondary. Increase Damage Given sits on two 35% self rows (Avalanche, Glacier's Will) above a bloodline passive of the same tag and is the tertiary amplifier route. Wound, shield and move are unsupported and untouched."
  },
